;-------------------------------------------------
;Bladder Torture
;Portal command where you can do various training commands to a 2hu's bladder
;Playing rain sounds, forcing them to put their hands in water, vibrator torture.
;Hard training command level: 2
;Flags required: Urination
;-------------------------------------------------
@ADD_CUSTOM_COM152

PRINTFORML How are you going to torture %CALLNAME:TARGET%'s bladder?
PRINTFORML [  0] - Poke %CALLNAME:TARGET%'s bladder
PRINTFORML [  1] - Place %CALLNAME:TARGET%'s hand in water
SIF ITEM:1
PRINTFORML [  2] - Put a massager on %CALLNAME:TARGET%'s bladder
PRINTFORML [  3] - Give %CALLNAME:TARGET% 1L of water
PRINTFORML [  4] - Drink 1L of water
INPUT
TIME += 1
TFLAG:144 = RESULT
SELECTCASE RESULT
CASE 0
CALL Com_BladderPoke
CASE 1
CALL Com_WaterHand
CASE 2
CALL Com_MassageBladder
CASE 3
CALL Com_ForceDrinkWater(TARGET)
CASE 4
CALL Com_ForceDrinkWater(MASTER)
ENDSELECT
RETURN 1

@Com_BladderPoke
PRINTFORML With your finger, you apply firm pressure on %CALLNAME:TARGET%'s bladder.
IF PeeBarStage(TARGET) >= 7
PRINTFORML When you touch it, it starts to leak uncontrolably...
PRINTFORML %CALLNAME:TARGET% starts to piss %HIS_HER(TARGET)%self silly.
CALL OSHIKKO_OMORASHI(TARGET)
ELSEIF PeeBarStage(TARGET) >= 5
PRINTFORML It feels full and rock solid, almost like %HE_SHE(TARGET)% is about to burst.
ELSEIF PeeBarStage(TARGET) >= 3
PRINTFORML It feels full, but is still squishy.
ELSE
PRINTFORML It feels empty and squishy.
ENDIF

DOWNBASE:体力 += 50
DOWNBASE:気力 += 60
BASE:尿意 += 50
SOURCE:MASTER:征服 += 5000
SOURCE:欲情 += 1000
SOURCE:恭順 += 1000
SOURCE:苦痛 += 200
SOURCE:反感 += 100
TIME += 4

@Com_WaterHand
PRINTFORML You grab a cup full of water and instruct %CALLNAME:TARGET% to put %HIS_HER(TARGET)% hand in it.
IF PeeBarStage(TARGET) >= 6
PRINTFORML As soon as %CALLNAME:TARGET% touches the water, %HIS_HER(TARGET)% bladder control becomes moot.
CALL OSHIKKO_OMORASHI(TARGET)
ELSEIF PeeBarStage(TARGET) >= 4
PRINTFORML %CALLNAME:TARGET% struggles to hold on, doing a full potty dance while also holding %HIS_HER(TARGET)%self with %HIS_HER(TARGET)% other hand.
PRINTFORML %HE_SHE(TARGET,1)% makes a small puddle from %HIS_HER(TARGET)% leaks.
ELSEIF PeeBarStage(TARGET) >= 2
PRINTFORML %CALLNAME:TARGET% squirms in desperation.
ELSE
PRINTFORML %CALLNAME:TARGET% waits there patiently.
ENDIF

DOWNBASE:体力 += 100
DOWNBASE:気力 += 110
BASE:尿意 += 100
SOURCE:MASTER:征服 += 5000
SOURCE:欲情 += 3000
SOURCE:恭順 += 5000
