@Com_MassageBladder
PRINTFORML Pulling out a wand massager, you place it on %CALLNAME:TARGET%'s bladder and turn it on.
IF PeeBarStage(TARGET) >= 5
PRINTFORML %CALLNAME:TARGET% struggles to hold on, trying everything to keep it in.
PRINTFORML Unfortunately, %HIS_HER(TARGET)% valiant effort wasn't enough to keep the flood at bay.
CALL OSHIKKO_OMORASHI(TARGET)
ELSEIF PeeBarStage(TARGET) >= 2
PRINTFORML %CALLNAME:TARGET% kicks and screams in desperation.
