DOWNBASE:体力 += 100
DOWNBASE:気力 += 110
BASE:尿意 += 150
SOURCE:MASTER:征服 += 5000
SOURCE:欲情 += 10000
SOURCE:恭順 += 16000
SOURCE:反感 += 1000
