@Com_ForceDrinkWater(ARG)
PRINTFORML You grab a liter of water and force %CALLNAME:ARG% to drink it down.
IF TCVAR:ARG:LiquidIntake <= 750
PRINTFORML %HE_SHE(ARG,1)% gladly drinks it all.

DOWNBASE:体力 -= 250
DOWNBASE:気力 -= 250
TCVAR:ARG:PeeConcentration -= 3
TCVAR:ARG:LiquidIntake += 1000
SOURCE:MASTER:征服 += 3500
SOURCE:欲情 += 5000
SOURCE:恭順 += 8000
SOURCE:反感 += 600
TIME += 5
ELSE
PRINTFORML %CALLNAME:ARG% doesn't seem to want to drink it.
PRINTFORML %HE_SHE(ARG,1)% feels full from the last drink.
ENDIF



